  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Dialogen over Belgi\u00eb (2020), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 1 time. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 1,282 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Dialogen over Belgi\u00eb by Elke Brems, Marnix Beyen, Ariane Bazan and others was published by Leuven University Press in 2020. Conceptually, the work connects to Humanities, Philosophy and Political science.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation. Notable citing venues include Memory Studies. The citing authors are based in Belgium.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,282 times via OAPEN. It is recorded in 1 library collection. Its subject matter aligns with Reduced inequalities among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>",
